## WS6.1 — Forecast Accountability: PARALLEL EXECUTION PLAN 🔥

### Purpose
**Sequential in merge, parallel in execution.** Attack WS6.1 from every angle simultaneously with zero conflicts. This is the **single biggest differentiator** — we ship this perfectly.

