## EXECUTION PHILOSOPHY

**Principle:** Methodical, Surgical, Revolutionary

```
Sequential Thinking → Parallel Execution → Sequential Validation → Sequential Merge
```

**Why Parallel:**
- 2-3 week timeline is aggressive
- Independent components can be built simultaneously
- Reduces bottlenecks, maximizes throughput
- Each component has clear acceptance criteria

**Why Sequential Validation:**
- Integration testing requires components to exist
- End-to-end flow requires all pieces working
- Merge order prevents conflicts (backend → frontend)

