## MERGE STRATEGY (Sequential, Not Parallel)

**Principle:** Merge in dependency order, not completion order.

### Merge Order:
1. **TASK 1 (Schema)** — Merge first (foundational, no dependencies)
   - Branch: `ws6.1/forecast-schema`
   - PR title: "ws6.1: add forecast schema + tables"
   - Review: 1-2 days
   - Merge to: `master`

2. **TASK 5 (Scorer)** — Merge second (pure logic, no external deps)
   - Branch: `ws6.1/accuracy-scorer`
   - PR title: "ws6.1: add Brier score + calibration calculations"
   - Review: 1 day
   - Merge to: `master`

3. **TASK 2 (Extractor)** — Merge third (uses schema, standalone logic)
   - Branch: `ws6.1/forecast-extractor`
   - PR title: "ws6.1: extract forecasts from reports"
   - Review: 1-2 days
   - Merge to: `master`

4. **TASK 3 & 4 (Outcome Trackers)** — Merge together (both use schema + scorer)
   - Branch: Rebase both onto `master` after TASK 2 merges
   - Combined PR: "ws6.1: add outcome tracking (markets + events)"
   - Review: 2 days
   - Merge to: `master`

5. **TASK 6 (Metrics API)** — Merge fifth (depends on all backend)
   - Branch: `ws6.1/metrics-api`
   - PR title: "ws6.1: add forecast metrics API endpoint"
   - Review: 1 day
   - Merge to: `master`

6. **TASK 7 (Frontend UI)** — Merge sixth (depends on API)
   - Branch: `ws6.1/accuracy-panel-ui`
   - PR title: "ws6.1: add forecast accuracy panel UI"
   - Review: 1 day
   - Merge to: `master`

7. **TASK 8 (Integration)** — Merge last (depends on everything)
   - Branch: `ws6.1/integration-testing`
   - PR title: "ws6.1: integrate accuracy panel + E2E tests"
   - Review: 1 day
   - Merge to: `master`

**Total Review + Merge Time:** ~10 days (with parallel reviews)

